WEBVTT

00:00:08.426 --> 00:00:10.177
[sighs]

00:00:13.556 --> 00:00:15.558
[snoring]

00:00:19.979 --> 00:00:21.564
-Did you get it?
-Oh, we got it.

00:00:21.647 --> 00:00:24.275
Come on, I had to frame you.

00:00:24.358 --> 00:00:25.860
<i>It was the only way to draw you--</i>

00:00:25.943 --> 00:00:27.278
Full confession.

00:00:27.361 --> 00:00:29.238
I can't believe she didn't
notice the camera.

00:00:29.321 --> 00:00:32.074
All we need to do is get this to the chief
and clear our names.

00:00:32.158 --> 00:00:33.159
-All right.
-We did it.

00:00:33.242 --> 00:00:34.243
-We did it.
-Oh, yeah.

00:00:34.326 --> 00:00:36.078
Touchdown dance!

00:00:38.247 --> 00:00:39.707
Hey, buddy.

00:00:40.416 --> 00:00:41.500
You okay?

00:00:42.001 --> 00:00:43.127
Huh?

00:00:43.878 --> 00:00:45.838
Oh. Uh... Nothing.

00:00:45.921 --> 00:00:49.300
Just imagining my next round
of thrilling job interviews.

00:00:50.259 --> 00:00:51.844
Wolfie, this is the plan.

00:00:51.927 --> 00:00:54.305
Yeah. No, I know. I'm just saying...

00:00:55.806 --> 00:00:56.974
[sighs] What am I saying?

00:00:57.057 --> 00:00:59.018
I'm just saying,
what if we took a wrong turn

00:00:59.101 --> 00:01:00.394
with the whole going good thing?

00:01:01.729 --> 00:01:02.813
You know what I mean?

00:01:03.689 --> 00:01:06.817
Yeah, but it's gonna be
different this time.

00:01:06.901 --> 00:01:09.278
"Captured the Phantom Bandit."

00:01:09.361 --> 00:01:10.821
That'll look great on your resume.

00:01:10.905 --> 00:01:12.782
We're gonna be heroes!
Piranha Street.

00:01:13.866 --> 00:01:15.701
Yeah, no, yeah. Totally.

00:01:16.202 --> 00:01:18.537
[scoffs] What am I talking about?
You're right.

00:01:18.621 --> 00:01:21.081
Come on,
let's find the chief. Let's go.

00:01:21.165 --> 00:01:22.625
That's my Wolf.

00:01:22.708 --> 00:01:24.627
[engine spluttering]

00:01:25.961 --> 00:01:26.962
Uh-oh.

00:01:27.963 --> 00:01:31.133
Did you really think
it was gonna be that easy?

00:01:31.217 --> 00:01:32.384
Shoot.

00:01:33.052 --> 00:01:34.470
-Hey!
-Watch it now.

00:01:34.553 --> 00:01:36.555
Naughty, naughty.

00:01:36.639 --> 00:01:38.349
Are these... gold?

00:01:38.849 --> 00:01:41.477
Kitty. Can we talk about this
for a second? Uh...

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:43.103
Nope.

00:01:45.815 --> 00:01:47.942
Is that MacGuffinite?

00:01:48.025 --> 00:01:49.068
What's going on?

00:01:49.777 --> 00:01:51.320
How about I show you?

00:01:56.116 --> 00:01:57.284
Oh, shiny!

00:01:59.161 --> 00:02:00.412
Hey, hey, hey, hey!

00:02:01.831 --> 00:02:03.040
[all scream]

00:02:07.002 --> 00:02:08.212
A gold magnet?

00:02:08.295 --> 00:02:10.339
You bet your scaly butt it is.

00:02:10.422 --> 00:02:12.466
And this is just a prototype.

00:02:12.550 --> 00:02:15.010
Wait till you see
what it can do in zero gravity.

00:02:15.094 --> 00:02:16.971
-You're taking it to space?
-[gasps]

00:02:17.054 --> 00:02:18.055
[Doom] Obviously.

00:02:18.138 --> 00:02:20.933
What do you think giant rocket is for?
Is not for science fair.

00:02:21.016 --> 00:02:24.562
You can't expect us to steal
all the world's gold from down here.

00:02:24.645 --> 00:02:27.606
The biggest heist in history!

00:02:27.690 --> 00:02:29.233
Courtesy of us.

00:02:29.316 --> 00:02:30.776
All the world's gold?

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:33.237
Oh, oh, and the cherry on top!

00:02:33.320 --> 00:02:35.072
Whoa, whoa, whoa. What are you doing?

00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:37.449
The video? You don't need to ruin Diane.

00:02:37.533 --> 00:02:39.743
Let's... Come on. Let's talk about this.

00:02:39.827 --> 00:02:43.247
Hmm. See, thing is, I promised
this rodent that I would.

00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:45.541
Kind of a quid pro quo type thing.

00:02:45.624 --> 00:02:46.792
Marmalade!

00:02:46.876 --> 00:02:49.753
I know. What a goofball. [chuckles]

00:02:49.837 --> 00:02:52.256
But a real wiz with the science stuff.

00:02:52.882 --> 00:02:54.174
I-I'll tell you what.

00:02:54.258 --> 00:02:57.761
"Cause we're friends,
I'm gonna give you a choice.

00:02:58.804 --> 00:03:00.931
[all scream, groan]

00:03:02.516 --> 00:03:03.934
No, no, no! Stop it!

00:03:04.518 --> 00:03:06.395
You can stop it with this.

00:03:10.316 --> 00:03:11.317
[Wolf] What the--

00:03:11.859 --> 00:03:13.569
[all panting]

00:03:14.486 --> 00:03:17.031
The upload is paired to the magnet.

00:03:17.114 --> 00:03:20.576
The moment you turn it off,
the video goes viral.

00:03:21.452 --> 00:03:23.954
Or leave it on, protect Diane,

00:03:24.038 --> 00:03:27.374
but y'all keep dangling
until the police arrive.

00:03:27.458 --> 00:03:29.877
Oh, such a dilemma!

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:31.670
[dial tone]

00:03:31.754 --> 00:03:33.130
The police?

00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:34.757
[Luggins] Hello. Commissioner speaking.

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:37.134
Yes, ma'am. I got a hot tip.

00:03:37.217 --> 00:03:41.305
The Bad Guys are holed up in a hangar
two klicks north of the MoonX launch site.

00:03:41.388 --> 00:03:42.598
[Luggins] What? Wait. Who is--

00:03:42.681 --> 00:03:43.766
-[phone beeps]
-[chuckles]

00:03:43.849 --> 00:03:46.018
Sorry, doll. Look, it's nothing personal.

00:03:47.019 --> 00:03:49.146
You are so hot right now.

00:03:49.229 --> 00:03:50.856
-[all] Snake!
-Yeah?

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:51.941
[Shark] Come on, man.

00:03:52.024 --> 00:03:54.443
You are one twisted reptile.

00:03:55.027 --> 00:03:57.446
I wish I could stick around
to see how it ends,

00:03:57.529 --> 00:03:59.907
but we've got a rocket to steal.

00:03:59.990 --> 00:04:00.991
Ciao!

00:04:01.617 --> 00:04:04.495
Kitty! Kitty, wait.
Hold on a second, please.

00:04:04.578 --> 00:04:06.664
[door opens, closes]

00:04:06.747 --> 00:04:08.791
[engine revs]

00:04:08.874 --> 00:04:09.875
See?

00:04:09.959 --> 00:04:11.627
This is why I'm not a cat person.

00:04:13.545 --> 00:04:15.381
How are we supposed to choose?

00:04:15.464 --> 00:04:17.132
We're not. I don't give up that easy.

00:04:17.216 --> 00:04:18.217
-Piranha.
-Yeah?

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:19.510
I need you to pull out the USB.

00:04:19.593 --> 00:04:21.553
-Follow my lead.
-You got it, papito.

00:04:21.637 --> 00:04:23.597
One, two...

00:04:25.349 --> 00:04:26.350
three!

00:04:26.433 --> 00:04:27.434
["Black Rose" playing]

00:04:27.518 --> 00:04:28.936
[shouts]

00:04:32.481 --> 00:04:33.774
I got it!

00:04:33.857 --> 00:04:35.401
And it's going faster!

00:04:35.484 --> 00:04:36.652
-Not good!
-New plan! Regroup!

00:04:37.361 --> 00:04:38.737
[all scream]

00:04:43.826 --> 00:04:45.828
[song continues]

00:05:01.719 --> 00:05:04.680
Webs, you got enough wiggle
in those legs to hack in?

00:05:04.763 --> 00:05:06.890
Three legs is all I need. I think.

00:05:06.974 --> 00:05:08.559
[Wolf] All right, let's go!

00:05:14.773 --> 00:05:16.400
[Tarantula] Wolf! Wolf! I can't get in!

00:05:16.483 --> 00:05:17.901
Fall back! Fall back!

00:05:18.819 --> 00:05:21.572
[all scream, groan]

